{"content":[{"c":["GEBER"],"sourceClass":"h1","t":"p"},{"c":["1. Alternate name for Ben-geber, one of Solomon’s commissariat officers, in ",{"href":"?bref=1Kgs.4.13","r":"1Kgs.4.13","rawR":"1Kgs.4.13","sourceRefs":[{"raw":"1Kgs.4.13","value":"1Kgs.4.13"}],"t":"ref","v":"1 Kings 4:13"},". ",{"c":["See"],"sourceClass":"ital","t":"span"}," ",{"href":"?item=BenGeber_Article_TyndaleOpenBibleDictionary","id":"BenGeber_Article_TyndaleOpenBibleDictionary","rawId":"BenGeber_Article_TyndaleOpenBibleDictionary","t":"link","v":"Ben-geber"},"."],"sourceClass":"list","t":"p"},{"c":["2. Uri’s son, who was responsible for providing food for Solomon’s household. His territory was probably south of Ramoth-gilead (",{"href":"?bref=1Kgs.4.19","r":"1Kgs.4.19","rawR":"1Kgs.4.19","sourceRefs":[{"raw":"1Kgs.4.19","value":"1Kgs.4.19"}],"t":"ref","v":"1 Kgs 4:19"},"). Perhaps #1 and #2 were related."],"sourceClass":"list","t":"p"}],"format":"bsb-study-dictionary-v2","id":"Geber","provenance":{"archiveSha256":"10758ea00dbea7540f9337e43e59c8e4000295c1261e3426bab6f31c31dcff5b","release":"1.6","sourceCitationReferences":[{"anchorText":"1 Kings 4:13","canonicalization":"deferred_to_dictionary_mapping_workstream","hrefExact":"?bref=1Kgs.4.13","rawQueryValue":"1Kgs.4.13","sourceRefExact":"1Kgs.4.13"},{"anchorText":"1 Kgs 4:19","canonicalization":"deferred_to_dictionary_mapping_workstream","hrefExact":"?bref=1Kgs.4.19","rawQueryValue":"1Kgs.4.19","sourceRefExact":"1Kgs.4.19"}],"sourceItemFragmentSha256":"40930d1629c1082f22a33b62e67384a9e15150bf8c3780197e60b90d63a6fc2a","sourceItemName":"Geber","sourceItemOrder":67,"sourceMember":"Articles/G.xml","supplementPointersNotIncludedAsContent":[]},"sourceAttributes":{"name":"Geber","product":"TyndaleOpenBibleDictionary","typename":"Article"},"sourceTitleExact":"Geber","title":"Geber","version":"v2-a101d843a2f0cd3fc0c6"}